        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Norse religion</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">c. 500 CE – c. 1100 CE</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Origin</span><span class="info-stat-val"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/scandinavia">Scandinavia</a>, from the religion of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/germanic-peoples">Germanic peoples</a> of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/iron-age">Iron Age</a>; best known from the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/viking-age">Viking Age</a>, about 800 to 1100</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Founder or early teachers</span><span class="info-stat-val">None: it was led by chieftains, kings and seeresses, without a founder or a priestly order</span></div>
